abstract: "A bounded Rust materialization of Bledar Gjata's proposed ESS-MAI AI Authority paradigm: independent executive competence under law within jurisdiction, demonstrated through scoped coordination, deterministic candidate elimination, current-evidence verification and durable five-cycle continuity. It does not certify the full architecture, general novelty or an external integration."
